{"articleNo":"175549","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=175549&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[한국품질재단] 2017 이공계 전문기술 연수사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.07.11","hit":"3000","attachments":[{"name":"2017 이공계 전문기술연수사업 참가신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=175549&attachNo=77691"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">미래창조과학부</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">와 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">한국산업기술진흥협회</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">가 시행하는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 이공계 전문기술연수사업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">은</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">한국의 미래 기술 인재인 이공계 대학 졸업자에게</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff5e00\"> </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff5e00; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">현장 실무형 직무교육과 기업현장연수</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">의 기회를 제공해 드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">한국품질재단은 </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">2007</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">~2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 연속으로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이공계 전문기술연수사업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우수 기관으로 선정되었으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, 2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년에도 우수 연수기관으로 선정되어 다음과 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이공계 전문기술연수사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">과정명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">품질</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">생산관리 실무</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 실시하오니 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">이공계열 대졸자에게 정부지원으로 직무능력향상 및 현장체험 교육을 실시하여 </span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">연수생의 취업지원 및 기업의 수요에 부합하는 우수 산업기술인력 양성을 목적으로 하는 연수사업입니다</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">* </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이공계 대졸</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전문대졸</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학원졸 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">미취업자로서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">32</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">세</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(1985.1.1 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이후출생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하인자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, 2017</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 졸업예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원제외대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">정부 실업대책 지원금 수혜 중인 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">동 사업에 참여하여 연수수당을 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회 이상 지급받은 자 또는 참여 중인 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학원 재학 중인 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우대대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTE